# # /union-one/
#
# https://w3id.org/union-one/ redirects to https://ontology.unionit.com.br/
#
# Persistent IRIs for the Union One ontology hub: the core module, sector
# packages and their releases, for example
# https://w3id.org/union-one/core/0.1.0/ and https://w3id.org/union-one/core/Event.
# The path is passed through unchanged; the target server resolves terms,
# versions and content negotiation.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Union Digital One
# GitHub username: mpatricio

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://ontology.unionit.com.br/$1 [R=302,L]
